    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14925" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρέθουσα</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰρ], ἡ,</span> name of several fountains, e.g.
		in Ithaca, <i><span class="en">
			Od.
			13.408
		</span></i>; at Syracuse, <i><span class="en">
			Str.
			6.2.4
		</span></i>: pl., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρῆναι ἀρέθουσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Choeril.
					2
				</span></i>
			:— Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρεθούσιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὅδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.362.18
				</span></i>
			. (A participial form; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρέθω</span></b>  is cited by Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.440
			</span></i> without expl.)</div>
